<section x-show="page==='labels'&&false" class="page-enter">
<div x-show="!labelFilterId"><div class="page-heading"><div><h1>برچسب‌ها</h1><p>برچسب‌های ساده برای پیدا کردن سریع‌تر کارها.</p></div><button class="button primary" @click="openLabel()"><span x-html="$icon('Plus')"></span>افزودن برچسب</button></div>
<div class="labels-list"><template x-for="l in labels" :key="l.id"><div class="label-list-row"><button class="label-row-main" @click="labelFilterId=l.id"><span class="label-hash" :style="`color:${l.color}`">#</span><strong x-text="l.name"></strong><span class="muted" x-text="fa(tasks.filter(t=>!t.completed_at&&t.labels.some(x=>x.id===l.id)).length)+' تسک'"></span></button><div x-data="{open:false}" class="label-row-menu" @click.outside="open=false"><button class="icon-btn" @click="open=!open" x-html="$icon('MoreHorizontal')" :aria-label="'گزینه‌های '+l.name"></button><div class="dropdown-menu" x-show="open" x-transition.opacity.scale.95.duration.150ms><button @click="openLabel(l);open=false">ویرایش</button><button class="danger-text" @click="deleteLabel(l);open=false">حذف</button></div></div></div></template><div class="empty-state" x-show="!labels.length"><h2>هنوز برچسبی ندارید</h2><p>برای دسته‌بندی کارها اولین برچسب را بسازید.</p></div></div></div>
<div x-show="labelFilterId"><div class="page-heading"><div><button class="text-button back-link" @click="labelFilterId=null"><span x-html="$icon('ArrowLeft')"></span>همه برچسب‌ها</button><h1><span class="label-hash" :style="`color:${selectedLabel?.color}`">#</span> <span x-text="selectedLabel?.name"></span></h1><p x-text="fa(selectedLabelTasks.length)+' تسک با این برچسب'"></p></div></div><div class="label-task-list"><template x-for="t in selectedLabelTasks" :key="t.id"><button class="label-task-row" @click="openTask(t)"><span class="completion" :class="{'checked':t.completed_at}"></span><span><strong x-text="t.title"></strong><small x-text="projects.find(p=>p.id===t.project_id)?.name"></small></span><span class="task-date" x-text="t.due_date?date(t.due_date):'بدون تاریخ'"></span></button></template><p class="empty-state" x-show="!selectedLabelTasks.length">تسکی با این برچسب نیست.</p></div></div>
</section>
<section x-show="page==='settings'" class="page-enter"><div class="page-heading"><div><h1>تنظیمات حساب</h1><p>اطلاعات و نمایی که در راستا می‌بینید.</p></div></div><div class="settings-panel panel"><div class="account-heading"><label class="avatar large avatar-upload" :class="{'is-loading':avatarUploading}" :aria-disabled="avatarUploading.toString()" title="تغییر تصویر پروفایل"><input class="sr-only" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" aria-label="تغییر تصویر پروفایل" :disabled="avatarUploading" @change="uploadAvatar($event.target.files[0]);$event.target.value=''"><template x-if="user.avatar_url"><img :src="user.avatar_url" :alt="user.name"></template><template x-if="!user.avatar_url"><span class="avatar-upload-initials" :style="`background:${color(user.id)}`" x-text="initials(user.name)"></span></template><span class="avatar-upload-overlay" aria-hidden="true"><span x-show="!avatarUploading" x-html="$icon('Upload')"></span><span x-show="avatarUploading" x-html="$icon('LoaderCircle')"></span></span></label><div><h2 x-text="user.name"></h2><p x-text="user.job_title"></p></div></div><form id="settings-account-form" class="settings-account-form" @submit.prevent="saveSettings()"><label>نام و نام خانوادگی<input x-model="account.name" required maxlength="100"><small class="field-error" x-text="err('name')"></small></label><label>عنوان شغلی<input x-model="account.job_title" required maxlength="100"><small class="field-error" x-text="err('job_title')"></small></label></form><div class="theme-settings"><div class="theme-settings-copy"><span class="theme-settings-icon" aria-hidden="true" x-html="$icon('Sun')"></span><div><strong>تم نمایش</strong><p>ظاهر راستا را برای این مرورگر انتخاب کنید.</p></div></div><div x-data="{open:false}" class="theme-picker" @click.outside="open=false" @keydown.escape.prevent="open=false;$refs.themePickerTrigger.focus()"><button x-ref="themePickerTrigger" type="button" class="theme-picker-trigger" aria-label="انتخاب تم نمایش" aria-haspopup="true" :aria-expanded="open.toString()" @click="open=!open"><span class="theme-picker-value"><span class="theme-picker-current-icon" aria-hidden="true"><span x-show="theme==='system'" x-html="$icon('Monitor')"></span><span x-show="theme==='light'" x-html="$icon('Sun')"></span><span x-show="theme==='dark'" x-html="$icon('Moon')"></span></span><span x-text="theme==='system'?'سیستم':theme==='light'?'روشن':'تاریک'"></span></span><span class="theme-picker-chevron" aria-hidden="true" x-html="$icon('ChevronDown')"></span></button><div class="dropdown-menu theme-picker-menu" x-show="open" x-cloak x-transition.opacity.scale.95.duration.150ms><button type="button" :class="{'selected':theme==='system'}" :aria-pressed="(theme==='system').toString()" @click="setTheme('system');open=false"><span class="theme-picker-option-icon" aria-hidden="true" x-html="$icon('Monitor')"></span><span>سیستم</span><span class="theme-picker-option-check" x-show="theme==='system'" aria-hidden="true" x-html="$icon('Check')"></span></button><button type="button" :class="{'selected':theme==='light'}" :aria-pressed="(theme==='light').toString()" @click="setTheme('light');open=false"><span class="theme-picker-option-icon" aria-hidden="true" x-html="$icon('Sun')"></span><span>روشن</span><span class="theme-picker-option-check" x-show="theme==='light'" aria-hidden="true" x-html="$icon('Check')"></span></button><button type="button" :class="{'selected':theme==='dark'}" :aria-pressed="(theme==='dark').toString()" @click="setTheme('dark');open=false"><span class="theme-picker-option-icon" aria-hidden="true" x-html="$icon('Moon')"></span><span>تاریک</span><span class="theme-picker-option-check" x-show="theme==='dark'" aria-hidden="true" x-html="$icon('Check')"></span></button></div></div></div><div class="settings-account-actions"><button class="button primary" form="settings-account-form" :disabled="busy" type="submit" x-text="busy?'در حال ذخیره...':'ذخیره تغییرات'"></button><form class="settings-logout-form" method="POST" action="/logout">@csrf<button class="button settings-logout-button danger-text" type="submit"><span x-html="$icon('LogOut')"></span>خروج از حساب</button></form></div></div></section>
